    743  f307
    744  f307							; the jmp bytes are mirrored in this bank); tail exits jmp $FBF8 (ReturnPad)
    745  f307							; so the bank0 jsr returns. Runs once per frame from TitleIntro. No jsr
    746  f307							; inside (fold depth must not nest). Guard: DropTarget == $FD.
    747  f307							;   0 fly right→140	1 drop→48  2 face left  3 arm bomb (fuse 180)
